{"prompt": "Write a resume for a fresh high school graduate who is seeking their first job. Make sure to include at least 12 placeholder represented by square brackets, such as [address], [name].", "response": "[Name]\n[Address]\n[City, State, Zip Code]\n[Phone Number]\n[Email Address]\n\n**OBJECTIVE**\nMotivated and reliable high school graduate seeking an entry-level position at [Company Name]. Eager to apply strong academic foundations, teamwork skills, and a positive attitude to contribute to [Department or Team Name] while developing professional experience.\n\n**EDUCATION**\n[High School Name]\n[City, State]\nGraduated: [Month, Year]\nGPA: [GPA, e.g., 3.8/4.0]\nRelevant Coursework: [Course 1], [Course 2], [Course 3]\n\n**EXPERIENCE**\n[Job Title or Volunteer Role]\n[Organization or Business Name]\n[City, State]\n[Start Date] \u2013 [End Date]\n*   Assisted with [specific task or responsibility]\n*   Collaborated with team members to [specific achievement or outcome]\n*   Demonstrated [key skill, e.g., customer service, time management] in a fast-paced environment\n\n**SKILLS**\n*   **Technical:** [Skill 1, e.g., Microsoft Office Suite], [Skill 2, e.g., Basic Data Entry]\n*   **Soft Skills:** Communication, Teamwork, Problem-Solving, Punctuality\n*   **Languages:** [Language 1], [Language 2]\n\n**EXTRACURRICULARS & INTERESTS**\n*   [Activity or Club Name]: [Brief description of role or achievement]\n*   [Hobby or Interest]: [Brief description of how it relates to work ethic or skills]\n\n**REFERENCES**\nAvailable upon request."}
